WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:02.920
Let's go next to our old friend.

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:08.240
Oh, Okafor from the 5 1 3.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:09.889
Hey, are you there?

00:00:09.889 --> 00:00:10.889
Yeah.

00:00:10.889 --> 00:00:11.889
Wow.

00:00:11.889 --> 00:00:12.900
Thank you so much for that shout out, of course.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.519
Hey, what's the correct pronunciation of your
first name?

00:00:15.519 --> 00:00:16.519
I know you go by.

00:00:16.519 --> 00:00:22.380
Oh, because it may be tough for some people
to pronounce, but how do you say it?

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.560
So it's actually only some do.

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:25.560
Okay, for.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:30.410
So, I mean, small story, like my parents are
actually from Nigeria, but I was actually

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:31.410
born here.

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:32.410
Right.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:33.410
Got it.

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:34.410
Very good.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:35.410
OK.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:36.410
OLISA Medawar.

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:37.410
I think I got it.

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:43.540
Yeah, why I was actually perfect, but yeah,
I just wanted to talk a little bit about the

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:49.360
progressive movement because a couple of weeks
I've been a little bit concerned because,

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:54.070
you know, with everything with Bernie Sanders
dropping out of the race and endorsing Joe

00:00:54.070 --> 00:01:01.110
Biden and, you know, his supporters turning
on him like I do, I feel like the progressive

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:03.790
movement at this very moment is in disarray.

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:07.750
And I was just wondering what your thoughts
are on what's going on right now.

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:12.780
So here here's what I'm going to lean towards
in the interests of cause.

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:15.820
Remember, oh, I want to remove Trump in November.

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:19.560
And I think I don't want to play a role in
dividing the left.

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:22.620
I want to unite the left as much as possible.

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:24.590
So here's my view.

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:32.880
The world of the Twitter, read it online,
left during the primary, made it seem like

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:37.310
the Bernie wing of the Democratic electorate
was bigger than it actually is.

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:42.799
And in the end, when it came to votes, Biden
got almost 3 million more votes than Bernie

00:01:42.799 --> 00:01:43.860
so far.

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:49.570
So what we learned was some of these ideas
are overrepresented if you pay too much attention

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:51.729
to read it and Twitter and the Internet.

00:01:51.729 --> 00:01:57.500
My instinct is and we're seeing it with our
callers today where we had, you know, a Yangs

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:00.130
supporter who's voting, Bernie, a socialist.

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:01.130
Who's voting Bernie.

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:02.130
I'm sorry.

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:03.130
Who's voting Biden?

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:04.130
Socialist is what?

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:06.790
Voting Biden and a former Bernie supporter
who is voting Biden?

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:11.829
My instinct is that the progressive movement
is not really very divided.

00:02:11.829 --> 00:02:18.099
I think that those who want to be loud and
boisterous and say, Joe's got to come for

00:02:18.099 --> 00:02:20.810
my vote, my vote's not a blank check.

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:21.810
I don't know anybody.

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:23.590
And I know all this stuff.

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:29.529
I think they're being way louder online than
they actually are in the electorate.

00:02:29.529 --> 00:02:34.519
I think most Bernie supporters, probably 90
percent, 88 to 90 percent are going to vote

00:02:34.519 --> 00:02:35.519
for Biden.

00:02:35.519 --> 00:02:38.719
The question is, will the 10 percent that
don't flip the election?

00:02:38.719 --> 00:02:39.840
I don't know the answer.

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:40.840
Gotcha.

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:44.459
Yeah, that's pretty much all I had.

00:02:44.459 --> 00:02:52.389
And the last thing I wanted to say is that
I was a Bernie Warren guy and I am 100 percent

00:02:52.389 --> 00:02:57.909
on board with Noam Chomsky and Bernie Sanders
that we must vote for Joe Biden and that we

00:02:57.909 --> 00:03:00.329
must defeat Donald Trump as well.

00:03:00.329 --> 00:03:01.329
All right.

00:03:01.329 --> 00:03:02.329
There we go.

00:03:02.329 --> 00:03:05.510
OLISA Medawar Okafor, I hope I got that correct.

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:06.819
Really appreciate your call.

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:07.819
You.

00:03:07.819 --> 00:03:08.819
Great.

00:03:08.819 --> 00:03:10.099
Have a great one.

00:03:10.099 --> 00:03:11.099
All right.

00:03:11.099 --> 00:03:12.099
Take care.

00:03:12.099 --> 00:03:12.104
Great to hear from them.

